 otal Cost Index (TCI)
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost 
 Index (TCI)\nPrimary Care Plus (PCPlus) Quality Webinar: Total Cost Index 
 (TCI)\nSep 23\, 2026\nWe invite PCPlus providers to a quality webinar seri
 es that educates providers and administrators on best practices related to
  quality measures in the PCPlus program. This series helps practices optim
 ize their performance and payment while aligning with industry best practi
 ces for population and patient health. MaineCare PCPlus quality measures c
 an be found on the\nPCPlus website\n.\nJoin us on\nSeptember 28\, 2026\nfr
 om 12:00-1:00 PM for our next webinar. We are partnering with The Cutler I
 nstitute to learn more about the TCI measure and review the measure’s sp
 ecifications. More information on the TCI measure can be found on the\nHea
 lth Partners Website\n.\nPlease register\nin advance for this meeting. Aft
 er registering\, you will receive a confirmation email with information ab
 out joining the meeting.\nFor questions about PCPlus\, please contact us a
 t\nPCP-Network-Services.DHHS@maine.gov\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/
 providers/provider-bulletins/primary-care-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-tota
 l-cost-index-tci-2026-09-23
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/primary-ca
 re-plus-pcplus-quality-webinar-total-cost-index-tci-2026-09-23
